---
description: C# Controller 層規範
globs: ["**/*Controller.cs"]
alwaysApply: false
---

## Swagger 文件（WebAPI — 必須）

新增或修改 Controller / Request / Response 時，**必須**依 `./aidata/csharp/rules/swagger.mdc` 產出完整 Swagger 文件（不可只寫邏輯）。重點：
- Request：每欄位 `<summary>`（含必填/選填說明）+ 必填 non-nullable；禁止 Model 上加 `[Required]` 等 attribute
- Response：每欄位 `<summary>` + 依語意標記 non-nullable（如 Id）或 nullable（如 DeletedAt）
- Action：每個端點 `<summary>`

---

## Controller Responsibilities

**ONLY allowed:**
- HTTP 參數綁定（見下方「參數綁定」）
- Call **exactly one** service interface method per action
- Map service result to HTTP response using framework helpers

---

## Route 設計 — MUST

- Route segment 必須使用 camelCase，禁止 kebab-case / snake_case（例如禁止 `ai-merge`、`get-user-by-id`）。
- 必填且用來定位資源、業務範圍或查詢主體的參數，必須放在 URI route segment，不可放 query string。
- Query string 僅用於選填篩選、排序、分頁、日期範圍等查詢條件。
- Route template 中的參數不加 `[FromRoute]` / `[FromQuery]`，由 ASP.NET Core 依名稱自動綁定。

```csharp
// ✅ Correct — gameType 是必填且定位回測球種，放 route segment
[HttpGet("aimerge/backtest/{gameType}/latest")]
public Task<AiBacktestResult> GetAiBacktestLatest(string gameType, string? date)
    => _aiMergeService.GetAiBacktestLatest(gameType, date);

// ❌ Wrong — route 使用 kebab-case，且必填 gameType 被放在 query string
[HttpGet, Route("ai-merge/backtest/latest")]
public Task<AiBacktestResult> GetAiBacktestLatest(string gameType, string date)
    => _aiMergeService.GetAiBacktestLatest(gameType, date);
```

---

## 參數綁定 — MUST

依參數在 URL 中的位置決定綁定方式，**不要**對 route template 內的參數加 `[FromQuery]`，也**不要**加 `[FromRoute]`（框架會依 route template 自動綁定）。

| 參數來源 | 寫法 | Attribute |
|---------|------|-----------|
| Route template 佔位（如 `getPgUser/{id:int}` 的 `id`） | 參數名稱與 template 一致 | **不加**（禁止 `[FromRoute]`、`[FromQuery]`） |
| Query string（route 中**沒有**對應佔位） | 簡單型別或 GET 用的 Request DTO | `[FromQuery]` |
| Request body（POST / PUT / PATCH 等） | Request Model | `[FromBody]` |

```csharp
// ✅ Route template 參數 — 不加 attribute
[HttpGet("getPgUser/{id:int}")]
public Task<PgUser> GetPgUser(int id)
    => _pgUserService.GetPgUserAsync(id);

[HttpPut("updatePgUser/{id:int}")]
public Task<PgUser> UpdatePgUser(int id, [FromBody] UpdatePgUserRequest request)
    => _pgUserService.UpdatePgUserAsync(id, request);

// ✅ Query string 參數 — 僅在「非 route 佔位」時加 [FromQuery]
[HttpGet("listCacheUsers")]
public Task<List<CacheUserDTO>> ListCacheUsers([FromQuery] string pattern = "*")
    => _cacheService.ListCacheUsersAsync(pattern);

[HttpGet("getOrders")]
public Task<GetOrdersResponse> GetOrders([FromQuery] GetOrdersRequest request)
    => _orderService.GetOrdersAsync(request);

// ✅ Body
[HttpPost("createPgUser")]
public Task<PgUser> CreatePgUser([FromBody] CreatePgUserRequest request)
    => _pgUserService.CreatePgUserAsync(request);

// ❌ Wrong — route 佔位卻用 FromQuery
[HttpGet("getPgUser/{id:int}")]
public Task<PgUser> GetPgUser([FromQuery] int id) => ...;

// ❌ Wrong — 多餘的 FromRoute
[HttpGet("getLangue/{countryCode}")]
public Task<string> GetLangue([FromRoute] string countryCode) => ...;
```

---

## Hard Constraints — MUST NOT

| Forbidden | Reason |
|-----------|--------|
| `[FromQuery]` on parameters that appear in the route template | Route 佔位應由框架自動綁定，不需 attribute |
| `[FromRoute]` on route template parameters | 多餘；ASP.NET Core 已依 template 名稱綁定 |
| Business rules / `if` / `switch` interpreting input correctness | Belongs in Service |
| Authorization / security decisions | Belongs in Service |
| Config reads (`IConfiguration`, `IECConfig`, secrets) | Belongs in Infrastructure |
| Serialization policy (`JsonSerializerOptions`, manual `Serialize`) | Belongs in Service |
| Loops over domain data | Belongs in Service |
| Read `Request.Headers` / `Query` for validation or decision | Pass `HttpContext` or snapshots to Service once |
| Write SQL or call DB directly | Belongs in Infrastructure |
| Instantiate dependencies with `new` | Use constructor injection |
| Call multiple service methods per action | Use orchestration in Service |

